    "UIName": "SRM-C Carrier",
    "Id": "vehicledef_CARRIER_SRM_C_SOCIETY",
    "Name": "SRM-C Carrier",
    "Details": "This variant of the LRM-AV Carrier replaces all its weapons with ten Clan SRM-6 launchers, keeping only the Clan Laser AMS and the Clan Guardian ECM. The limited ammunition left enough weight for a much stronger Clan XL engine, which gives the SRM-C Carrier a substantial speed upgrade. Crews often use that speed to close suddenly to short range and then unload every launcher on a target. Like the LRM-AV, it is widely used by intervention teams and front-line units.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 5/8 hexes / 150/240 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Hardened (C)\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       155     30\n<b>Left</b>         125     30\n<b>Right</b>       125     30\n<b>Rear</b>        105     30\n\n<b>Total</b>      510    120</color>",
    "Icon": "LRMcarrier"
  },
